# Force LF line endings for all text source files, regardless of the
# checking-out platform's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier/ESLint expect LF;
# a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true was rewriting every file to
# CRLF, which prettier/prettier flagged as an error on every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
